      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Benjaire Flow · Status updates\nThe owner alert links to GET /webhook/flow-status. That only shows a confirm page, so email link scanners cannot change anything. The Confirm button POSTs to /webhook/flow-status-confirm, which checks the reference and its one time token, updates the status, logs it, and on a first win sends the client the welcome and onboarding email.",
